{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/974430-the-silver-ladder-picture","id":974430,"title":"The Silver Ladder Picture","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-09-22T08:40:51-07:00","id":974430,"title":"The Silver Ladder Picture","content":"I Was rereading the book and for the life of me,i cant' see to understand what the hell the drawing on the Silver Ladder page is suppossed to mean. I Just can't,it's just some Nuns gving a mean look! no matttter how long i look at it i can't see how that supposed to be The Silver Ladder,can someone explain?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-22T08:56:37-07:00","id":974441,"title":"","content":"It is, I am fairly sure, meant to be the Silver Ladder (in the person of the two non-nun ladies on the right) making a donation to the nuns running the &quot;Halfway House&quot; in the background. Which is the sort of thing the Ladder do - help people help one another, empowering both the person helped and the person helping.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12425-general-tacticus","name":"General Tacticus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"39"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-22T08:59:03-07:00","id":974444,"title":"","content":"Out of the whole book, I think the one thing that doesn't work for me on any level is the artwork for the orders. The mysterium is at least a little on track, some mages going to look for lost relics in a forgotten temple in the mountains, but the rest don't do anything for me. Heck, the Guardians of the Veil art appears to be a hobo fight with someone going a full Naruto Chidori. How the heck does that show an Order of mages who believe in magic only being used by the worthy, focus on keeping magic hidden and upholding their laws.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5439-gullinbursti","name":"Gullinbursti","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5439_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"291"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-22T08:59:06-07:00","id":974445,"title":"","content":"I don't like it either. It reinforces what I think is the most boring stereotype about the Ladder - that they're The Man, all Telling You What To Do, when I think the way more interesting take is that they're the revolutionary firebrands, court viziers, and lawyers of the setting.<br /> <br /> The piece does, however, fall squarely into the grand tradition of completely baffling Silver Ladder art","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12136-jacobkosh","name":"jacobkosh","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12136_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"47"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-22T09:00:07-07:00","id":974446,"title":"","content":"You weren't a fan of fl